# The Slasher attacks into Bot2's Quantum Riddler (4/6) and is blocked: no combat damage is dealt to a player, so Bot2 does
# not lose half their life (20 stays 20). Deathtouch (CR 702.2) kills the Riddler with 2 damage; the Riddler's 4 damage kills the
# 2/3 Slasher, which had no counters, and it returns tapped with two stun counters.

